      "html": "<figure class=\"dvb card-outlined\" aria-label=\"「支援制度があれば移住を検討」年代別 賛成/反対\">\n  <figcaption class=\"dvb-title\">「支援制度があれば移住を検討」年代別 賛成/反対</figcaption>\n  <div class=\"dvb-legend\">\n    <span class=\"dvb-key a\"><i></i>賛成</span>\n    <span class=\"dvb-key b\"><i></i>反対</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dvb-rows\">\n    <div class=\"dvb-row\">\n      <span class=\"dvb-val a\">71%</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track a\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:100%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-cat\">20代</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track b\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:20%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-val b\">14%</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dvb-row\">\n      <span class=\"dvb-val a\">64%</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track a\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:90%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-cat\">30代</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track b\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:30%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-val b\">21%</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dvb-row\">\n      <span class=\"dvb-val a\">52%</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track a\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:73%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-cat\">40代</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track b\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:46%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-val b\">33%</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dvb-row\">\n      <span class=\"dvb-val a\">43%</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track a\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:61%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-cat\">50代</span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-track b\"><span class=\"dvb-fill\" style=\"--w:62%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dvb-val b\">44%</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</figure>",
